exercises.prompt:
A harder trace — callbacks queueing callbacks across both queues. Predict the order, then run the solution to verify. (The solution was executed to confirm; trust the trace, not your gut.)

```js
console.log('1');
setTimeout(() => {
  console.log('2');
  Promise.resolve().then(() => console.log('3'));
}, 0);
Promise.resolve().then(() => {
  console.log('4');
  setTimeout(() => console.log('5'), 0);
});
console.log('6');
```

Expected solution output:
```
1
6
4
2
3
5
actual: 1 → 6 → 4 → 2 → 3 → 5
```

